.TH QUIPU-FOLLOW 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-follow \- Keep this database a read\-only follower of a primary server
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu follow\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-primary\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-txs\fR] [\fB\-\-page\-gap\-ms\fR] [\fB\-\-bootstrap\-only\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Keep this database a read\-only follower of a primary server
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-primary\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-page\-txs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-page\-gap\-ms\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-bootstrap\-only\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
